// Dialog :
"P462246839" "You found out information regarding Praetor White and the Destroyers"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3575294904" "You've found some interesting information about Praetor White and the Destroyers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P783450698" "What did you find, {HeroName}?<br><br>...<br><br>Wow! This is <i>shocking</i>! I never would've guessed that the Destroyers were part of Praetor White's old gang. This makes total sense! Well, um, sort of. One part seems weird. He's not giving them the Fixadine! Er, well, he is, but he didn't give it to them <i>originally</i>. What do you think that means? And does this whole thing mean that Praetor White is the one directing the Destroyers here in Imperial?<br><br>This is all getting really intense, {HeroName}! Here, take my cellphone number, you can contact me at any time with this, any time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MarauderDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P3015647499" "{HeroName}, what's going on? Gotta say, nothin' bad has been happenin' in that lab of mine ever since you took out that trash there. You got some more news for me?"
// Answer Text :
"P1079793322" "There's documents about your relation to the Destroyers, White."
// Page Relation Text :
"P1464384732" "There is? Damn! I shoulda known Cole or Sinclair wouldn't have just let that pass. You know, they clear out all the little stuff they don't want people to know about <i>them</i>, but then they keep my secrets around, just in case of emergencies. Pretty nice of them, eh?<br><br>I gotta say, I ain't got no clue about what the Destroyers are doin' over in Imperial, I've just been moving around the ones here in Nova."
// Answer Text :
"P975714823" "You didn't originally give them the Fixadine, did you?"
// Page Original Text :
"P967031075" "I wouldn't have done that to my boys, {HeroName}. They were strong, they knew how to fight. But I had to leave 'em behind to get this spot in the new world, you hear?<br><br>It all came down one day when they started seepin' into Praetoria, all hooked up on that stuff. I had to put 'em down, they were actin' all pals to me. I tried forcin' them off of the stuff, but once you're hooked, you're done for. They became weak little sticks without the drugs, you understand?<br><br>That's why I got some of the boys to figure out how to make the stuff and set up that lab. I don't know <i>who</i> originally gave it to them, but I'm guessin' the person that's behind is it the one leadin' things in Imperial City. This ain't good, {HeroName}, ain't good one bit."
// Answer Text :
"P2233847856" "This is going to get revealed soon, White, if something isn't done."
// Page Revealed Text :
"P2493985781" "You think I don't know that? I know that!<br><br>Look, I'm gonna have to ask you for a solid favor, {HeroName}. You're my main {Hero.gender=male man|woman} on this Fixadine thing, but I gotta step away from it now. We gotta remove any sign of it from Nova Praetoria. I need you to go back down to the lab and wipe it off of Nova, if you get my drift.<br><br>You do that, I'll spread the word that you went and took down the main Destroyer hub here in Nova, I know you got stuff going on with that whole fame and glory thing. I'll keep it a secret that you were workin' for me, and you'll keep it a secret that I was givin' them the crush. Sound like a deal?"
// Answer Text :
"P30845621" "You've got a deal. I'm on my way."
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P3756747387" "{HeroName}, huh? What do you want from me? I got plenty of stuff to get done today, and none of it is involvin' having tea and crumpets with you."
// Answer Text :
"P1167267027" "(Show Praetor White your information on him.)"
// Page Info Text :
"P1940447621" "...so, this info is still hangin' around. What, you plan on makin' this public? You wanna make somethin' of this right here in the Magisterium?"
// Answer Text :
"P1391138793" "I'm here to make a deal, White. Are you behind the movements in Imperial?"
// Page ImperialMove Text :
"P133509879" "I ain't behind anything in Imperial, I got enough stuff goin' on here. You saw that document, I ain't the one who originally gave them the drugs. But how it is now is how it is. My boys wanted to be strong, and the only way they could keep bein' strong was by stayin' on that Fixadine.<br><br>I ain't gonna totally abandon them, but they gotta prove themselves to me, you understand? But I'm makin' this clear, I only got leashes on the Destroyers here in Nova. Whatever is going on in Imperial ain't my call. Now that you got me thinkin', though, I'm bettin' whoever first gave them the Fixadine is behind this stuff in Imperial."
// Answer Text :
"P2584846847" "Something is going to have to be done about this, White."
// Page Something Text :
"P3773022368" "Yeah, I'm aware of that. I'm gonna make ya a deal, {HeroName}. I ain't got the time right now to handle this myself, mainly 'cause if I did, folks would get suspicious. I'll give ya the location of the Fixadine lab that I got goin' on. If you go in there and blow it up, I'll make sure the right people know that you went and took out the main base of operations of the Destroyers here in Nova. I'm sure that'll give ya all the fame and whatever you wanna do with it. I'll keep it between you and me that I tipped you off, and you keep your mouth shut that I got any links to this. Last thing I need is more problems, I got enough of them puttin' up with Cole and that brat Duncan."
// Answer Text :
"P3867749040" "We've got ourselves a deal, White."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1681425145" "So, um, I know this might be a bit risky to suggest this, but you might want to go bring this information to Praetor White. I kind of get the feeling that, um, well, he's not the one behind all this. You don't need to worry about him taking you out in the middle of the Magisterium, though. I, uh, talked with Praetor Sinclair about the situation. He's going to have some of his, well, <color yellow>agents</color> in the area. They're not especially powerful, but they're fast. If Praetor White tries to take a swing at you, they'll swoop in and get you out of there. How's that sound?"
// AcceptString :
"P1166785384" "Sounds like a plan. I'll see what White can tell me."
// SendOffString :
"P1075078913" "Super! I'll be rooting for you over here! It might even just be a lot safer to call Praetor White if you can, much safer. I'm all about just calling people up to discuss important matters with them."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3470434105" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Finishing What He Started</color>"

