// Dialog :
"P3310470781" "The smell of burning Fixadine fills the air. That's the last the Destroyers will see of their main stash in Nova Praetoria."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P909032357" "{HeroName}, it is SO funny that you're here. TPN is running a report from Praetor White about you <i>right</i> now! Here, I've got it going on my phone, check it out!<br><br><color orange>Tami shows you the report that TPN is running. Praetor White is speaking with many reporters about the Destroyer menace. He mentions you specifically by name. A headshot photo of you is shown in the top right corner of the screen. Praetor White explains how you were investigating the Destroyers in Nova and eliminated their main base of operations. The reporters all burst into a murmur, making clarifications that it's, 'the {HeroName} of Imperial City' and not, 'the {HeroName} from Old Orlando'. Praetor White specifies that it's you.</color><br><br>Endorsement deals from Praetor White, that's pretty great! But we still have our problems here with the Fixadine in Imperial City. I got a feeling though that something will break! If the Destroyers in Nova don't have any of their main stash left, I'm sure they'll be going to Imperial to find the main lab!"
// RandomFameString :
"P287891925" "I hear Praetor White and {HeroName} could be the new dream team of Praetoria!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3569849040" "Those Destroyers, they're, uhm, so predictable, you know? Not like you, or me, or Praetor Sinclair. Mr. G gave me some prime information on the Destroyer movements, prime information. After you took out their main lab in Nova Praetoria, a bunch made a straight line for some of the old tunnels in Imperial City. Seems weird, don't you think? Almost like they either <i>knew</i> it existed or someone <i>told</i> them to go there. I've got the location right here, {HeroName}. I think this lead right here is gonna get us the information we need: the identity of the true leader of the Destroyers!"
// AcceptString :
"P1463184120" "I'll see what I can find down there."
// SendOffString :
"P1471457270" "Great! Perfect! You'll wanna blow up anything you find down there, of course. But most importantly, you need to get any information on the Destroyer leader. I bet it's going to be <i>real</i> juicy and not something boring, like, 'Oh, it was random person A who was the leader all along'. <i>That</i> would be very unfortunate."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1097568420" "Destroy the main Fixadine lab in Imperial City"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3187646311" "You should be careful about breathing the fumes in that lab."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P841907305" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Seeing what She Started</color>"

