// SaysList :
"P529142438" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkKhaki>Look at {HeroName} go! Do the Destroyers have ANY hope?! I don't think they do!"
// SaysList :
"P3205451160" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkKhaki>I'm counting forty Destroyers down! This is amazing! The skill! The devotion that {HeroName} has!"
// SaysList :
"P3063950834" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkKhaki>One has to wonder just HOW scared the Destroyers are of {HeroName}'s sheer skill! I don't even think {HeroName} is TRYING!"
// SaysList :
"P98186225" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkKhaki>If I was part of the Resistance, I'd be terrified right now! This goes to show, the people of Praetoria are safe and sound!"
// SaysList :
"P2961343192" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkKhaki>IT'S OVER! The last of this Destroyer horde are GONE! The people of TPN and of Imperial City can rest easy! Stay tuned for our shocking report on Praetor Duncan!"

